# QA Agent — Runners

- Typed runners only: map validated JSON to an allowlisted step set. Never `eval` or run arbitrary LLM-generated code.
- UI → Playwright (Chromium); API → our HTTP checks module.
- MVP executes P0 cases only. P1/P2 may appear in the testcase list but must not run.
- Every case has a timeout. Persist screenshots and logs as Action artifacts.
- Runners live under `src/qa-agent/runner/` and are invoked only from the QA Agent Action.
